## 6. Safety & Operational Notes
- PTFE liner prevents gallium creep; TiC contains sonic pressures.  
- Galinstan contained; micro-bubbles fully sealed (no mercury vapor release).  
- Piezo healing mode operates at non-thermal intensities (<0.1 °C rise).  
- Eye/ear protection recommended for Energy Head testing.  
-  Burst intensified at healing-head crossover by piezo + micro-bubble synergy.

**Status:** Prototype-ready conceptual design.  
